Feature: TC_09_STAFF - Supplementary Payments Roles E2E Regression Pack

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Legacy  : "Regression Pack for Requesting Supplementary Payments" (BISSAGL-5743, AT-TC-01 to 05,
  #           tmslinks BISSAGL-14868 / 14825 / 14829 / 14826 / 14825)
  # Rewritten 15-10-2026 in the StaffSteps vocabulary (the wording the MAPS features run with). One end-to-end
  # scenario covering all five legacy role sets; # SECTION markers show where each legacy scenario starts.
  #
  # Purpose:
  #   Which BISS roles may request a supplementary payment. Each section:
  #     1. the SSO super admin (agr0043) removes every BISS role from test user agr0191 and assigns one role set
  #     2. agr0191 logs in, opens a herd with payments, and either
  #        - can open "Request Supplementary Payment" and sees the reason dropdown and the three control dates, or
  #        - (read-only roles) does not see the Payments screen at all
  #
  # Test data (kept as literals):
  #   Herd A1110015, scheme year 2024 - a herd with payments (legacy took rows 1-6 of "Get Herds with Payments";
  #   the same herd serves every section because nothing is changed on it, only access is checked).
  #   Logins: agr0043 (SSO super admin), agr0191 (the user whose roles change), agr4442 (BISS Co-ordination 1,
  #   Section 5). Password: TD:Password from the TestData row of this test case, the same for all three.
  #
  # Step definitions: stepdefinitions.BISS.STAFF.StaffSteps (Section 15 - SSO Administration, Section 16 - Payments)
  # Author: Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  @regression @staff @payments @roles @sso @e2e
  Scenario: AT-STAFF-PAY-ROLES-E2E-01 - Staff assigns BISS roles through SSO Administration and verifies supplementary payment access

    # SECTION 1 : Co-ordination 1 + 2, Processing 3, Inspections 3, Risk 3 - AT-TC-01 (BISSAGL-14868)
    Given the staff user is logged in to the SSO Administration portal as "agr0043"
    When the staff user replaces the BISS roles of user "agr0191" with the following
      | filter        | role                        |
      | CO-ORDINATION | BISS Co-ordination 1        |
      | CO-ORDINATION | BISS Co-ordination 2        |
      | PROCESSING    | BISS Processing 3           |
      | INSPECTIONS   | BISS Inspections 3          |
      | RISK          | BISS Risk Management 3 User |
    And the staff user signs out of the portal
    Given the staff user is logged in to the BISS internal portal as "agr0191"
    When the staff user opens the application for herd "A1110015" for scheme year "2024"
    Then the supplementary payment request form should be available
    When the staff user signs out of the portal

    # SECTION 2 : Processing 1, Inspections 1, Payment QA 1 + 2, ENTS, EMS, Risk 1 - AT-TC-02 (BISSAGL-14825)
    Given the staff user is logged in to the SSO Administration portal as "agr0043"
    When the staff user replaces the BISS roles of user "agr0191" with the following
      | filter      | role                        |
      | PROCESSING  | BISS Processing 1           |
      | INSPECTIONS | BISS Inspections 1          |
      | PAYMENT     | BISS Payment QA 1 User      |
      | PAYMENT     | BISS Payment QA 2 User      |
      | ENTS        | BISS ENTS User              |
      | EMS         | BISS EMS User               |
      | RISK        | BISS Risk Management 1 User |
    And the staff user signs out of the portal
    Given the staff user is logged in to the BISS internal portal as "agr0191"
    When the staff user opens the application for herd "A1110015" for scheme year "2024"
    Then the supplementary payment request form should be available
    When the staff user signs out of the portal

    # SECTION 3 : Read Only - the Payments screen is not offered - AT-TC-03 (BISSAGL-14829)
    Given the staff user is logged in to the SSO Administration portal as "agr0043"
    When the staff user replaces the BISS roles of user "agr0191" with the following
      | filter | role                |
      | READ   | BISS Read Only User |
    And the staff user signs out of the portal
    Given the staff user is logged in to the BISS internal portal as "agr0191"
    When the staff user opens the application for herd "A1110015" for scheme year "2024"
    Then the staff user should not have access to the "Payments" tab
    When the staff user signs out of the portal

    # SECTION 4 : Processing 2, Risk 2 - AT-TC-04 (BISSAGL-14826)
    Given the staff user is logged in to the SSO Administration portal as "agr0043"
    When the staff user replaces the BISS roles of user "agr0191" with the following
      | filter     | role                        |
      | PROCESSING | BISS Processing 2           |
      | RISK       | BISS Risk Management 2 User |
    And the staff user signs out of the portal
    Given the staff user is logged in to the BISS internal portal as "agr0191"
    When the staff user opens the application for herd "A1110015" for scheme year "2024"
    Then the supplementary payment request form should be available
    When the staff user signs out of the portal

    # SECTION 5 : Inspections 2 for agr0191; the check is made as Co-ordination 1 (agr4442) - AT-TC-05 (BISSAGL-14825)
    Given the staff user is logged in to the SSO Administration portal as "agr0043"
    When the staff user replaces the BISS roles of user "agr0191" with the following
      | filter      | role               |
      | INSPECTIONS | BISS Inspections 2 |
    And the staff user signs out of the portal
    Given the staff user is logged in to the BISS internal portal as "agr4442"
    When the staff user opens the application for herd "A1110015" for scheme year "2024"
    Then the supplementary payment request form should be available
